contentText:
Aria Vega talks about the success of the “Chévere” remix with Ryan Castro, one of the biggest Latin songs of the year. She shares how the collaboration came together, her reaction to the song’s impact on the charts and the personal story that shaped her path in music. Aria also talks about her roots in Barranquilla, Colombia, her family’s influence, how Shakira helped define her sound, the creation of her “Costeñita Core” movement and what she’s learned in this new chapter.

